  "text": {
    "tagline": "Centralised administration of the boom and the bap.",
    "blurb": "FREE with Computer Rhythm issue 14: the FULL Beat Management Console pack, worth £30! {count} hip-hop presets for the sound recorder synths: boom bap, lo-fi, trap and trip-hop. Exclusive to CR readers.",
    "intro": [
      "Welcome to Cover CD 14! This month we have something special: the complete Beat Management Console pack, worth £30 in the shops, FREE to every Computer Rhythm reader.",
      "{count} presets of dusty keys, 808s, bells and vinyl texture for the sound recorder synths. Our reviews desk gave it 9/10 last issue. Turn to page 42 for the step-by-step walkthrough, and page 46 for our beat-making masterclass."
    ],
    "maker_note": [
      "Every month we try to put something on the disc that we would pay for ourselves. This month it was easy.",
      "Send us your beats! The best tracks made with the pack go on Cover CD 16. See page 98 for how to send them in.",
      "Fiona Garrity, Disc Editor"
    ],
    "install": [
      "Insert the Cover CD. In the Library tab it appears as the drive CRCD14.",
      "Open a folder (Keys, Bass, Bells and the rest) and double-click a preset.",
      "Stuck? Ring the reader helpline (weekdays 10am-4pm) or see page 42."
    ],
    "license": [
      "TERMS OF USE",
      "The Beat Management Console pack is supplied free to readers of Computer Rhythm for their own use. Music made with it is yours.",
      "This disc is not for sale separately. You may not copy it or upload its contents.",
      "Hollingworth Periodicals Ltd has checked this disc for viruses but cannot accept responsibility for any damage, loss or disruption. Always back up your work."
    ],
    "copyright": "(C) 1998 Hollingworth Periodicals Ltd. Computer Rhythm is published 13 times a year.",
    "files": {
      "FAULTY.TXT": [
        "|FAULTY DISC?",
        "If your Cover CD does not work, first check it in another drive. If it is faulty, put it in an envelope with a note of your name and address and send it to:",
        "|    Disc Returns, CR14, PO Box 155, Bath BA1 1XX",
        "We will send you a new one within 28 days. Do not send it to the editorial office."
      ],
